      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GitHub Copilot CLI now supports Microsoft Entra authentication in public preview.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can sign in with your Microsoft Entra account to silently authenticate to a linked GitHub Enterprise Managed User (EMU) account, use your Microsoft 365 Copilot license, or both, depending on your organization&rsquo;s entitlements.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Microsoft Entra authentication for both EMUs and Microsoft 365 Copilot is currently supported on Windows and macOS.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For enterprises using EMUs via OIDC , GitHub Copilot CLI now supports silent SSO using Microsoft Entra authentication.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can access GitHub from GitHub Copilot CLI using your Microsoft Entra identity without a separate GitHub sign-in.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You must have an assigned Copilot Business or Copilot Enterprise license, and your organization must enable the Copilot CLI policy.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this scenario, GitHub Copilot CLI uses GitHub inference, and usage is governed by the organization&rsquo;s GitHub Copilot plan.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If your organization is in Frontier and has a Microsoft 365 Copilot license with usage-based billing, Microsoft Entra authentication lets you access models available through Microsoft Copilot directly from the terminal.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this scenario, GitHub Copilot CLI uses Microsoft 365 inference rather than GitHub inference, and you don&rsquo;t need a GitHub account.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Model access and usage limits are managed through your organization&rsquo;s Microsoft 365 Copilot settings, not GitHub.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:57.066Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To take advantage of these capabilities, GitHub Copilot CLI version 1.0.113 or later is required.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
